{"step_index":710,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T18:09:00Z","content":"### What Caused the Blank Screen & What Was Fixed:\n\n1. **Root Cause:**\n   - In `ListsScreen.tsx`, there was a duplicate `styles` block generated at the bottom of the file that caused an initial parsing stall, and `App.tsx` had an async bootloader check trying to seed legacy lists.\n2. **The Fix:**\n   - Cleaned the entire `ListsScreen.tsx` codebase and styles.\n   - Streamlined `App.tsx` startup so the app loads instantly without blocking or waiting on any legacy list checks.\n   - Rebuilt production bundle and deployed live to **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**.\n\n---\n\n### Test on Your Phone:\n1. Re-open **SnapDialer** on your iPhone (or pull down to refresh in Safari).\n2. The app will immediately load into your clean **Educator Pipeline** dashboard with your top stats, quick search, and 1-tap **\"Snap Sheet\"** / **\"Start Power Dialing\"** buttons!"}
